<title>USA: Scan-Optics to ship $20mln order to Japan.</title>
<headline>Scan-Optics to ship $20mln order to Japan.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, Conn. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ScanOptics Inc has received an order valued at more than $20 million, the company said in a release on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The order is for 35 systems, which are to be shipped and delivered in 1997.</p>
<p>The company said that the order will double current processing capabilities of medical claim systems earmarked or installed in Japan.</p>
</text>
